                "text": "Gravy-like)\n* **Dosa Masala (Dosa Aloo):** This is a **dry or semi-dry, cohesive mixture**"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                0,
                5
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 446,
                "end_index": 467,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "It acts as a stuffing"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                5
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 469,
                "end_index": 569,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "If the stuffing has too much liquid, it will quickly make the crispy dosa crepe soggy, wet, and limp"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                2,
                3
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 571,
                "end_index": 648,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "* **Poori Masala (Poori Curry):** This is a **semi-liquid, gravy-like curry**"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                5,
                6
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 650,
                "end_index": 768,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "It is meant to be a \"dipping curry\" so you can easily scoop up the flavorful, runny gravy using pieces of puffed poori"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                3
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 779,
                "end_index": 868,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "The Use of Besan (Gram/Chickpea Flour)\n* **Dosa Masala:** Typically contains **no besan**"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                4,
                7
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 870,
                "end_index": 923,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "The thickness comes entirely from the mashed potatoes"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                3,
                8
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 925,
                "end_index": 1126,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "* **Poori Masala:** In classic South Indian restaurants (often called \"hotel-style\" poori masala), a small amount of **besan (chickpea flour) slurry** is mixed with water and simmered with the potatoes"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                1,
                7
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 1128,
                "end_index": 1229,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "This gives the gravy a silky, glossy, velvety texture that helps the curry coat the poori beautifully"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                9
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 1266,
                "end_index": 1344,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "Chunky)\n* **Dosa Masala:** The boiled potatoes are **mashed quite thoroughly**"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                4,
                7
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 1346,
                "end_index": 1496,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "There are very few large lumps so that the cook can easily and evenly spread the potato mixture across the inside of the dosa crepe without tearing it"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                10
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 1498,
                "end_index": 1563,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "* **Poori Masala:** The potatoes are **crumbled roughly by hand**"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                10
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 1565,
                "end_index": 1722,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "While some bits are mashed to naturally thicken the gravy, the dish is characterized by distinct, uneven, chunky potato pieces that provide a satisfying bite"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                3
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 1732,
                "end_index": 1816,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "Ingredients: Tomatoes & Extra Vegetables\n* **Dosa Masala:** Usually kept very simple"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                3
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 1818,
                "end_index": 1855,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "It **almost never contains tomatoes**"
              },
              "rendered_parts": null
            },
            {
              "confidence_scores": null,
              "grounding_chunk_indices": [
                3,
                5
              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 1857,
                "end_index": 1956,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "Tomatoes release a lot of moisture and acid, which would compromise the dry texture of the stuffing"
