              "segment": {
                "start_index": 2166,
                "end_index": 2327,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "It is also common to see other vegetables like **green peas and carrots** added to poori masala for extra flavor and color (such as in Karnataka's *Potato Sagu*)"
